Project Title
Arduino-Based Digital Overcurrent Relay with IDMT Characteristics

Description
This project simulates a digital overcurrent relay using Arduino. It monitors line current and trips the circuit when current exceeds a predefined pickup value, following inverse-time characteristics.

Key Features
Adjustable pickup current

IDMT-based tripping

Manual reset

LCD fault display

Applications
Feeder protection

Transformer protection

Industrial motor protection

Future Scope
True RMS measurement

CT sensor integration

Communication (Modbus/IoT)
